@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title Shared Use Case - Staff and Manager Human Design-Request Review
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

actor "Staff" as Staff
actor "Manager" as Manager

rectangle "Personalized Product Sales and Workshop Booking System" {
  usecase "Review feasibility request" as Review
usecase "Record review outcome" as Decision
  usecase "Record actor, reason\nand decision context" as Audit
  usecase "Return reviewed outcome\nto customer" as Outcome
}

Staff --> Review
Manager --> Review
Staff --> Decision
Manager --> Decision
Review .> Audit : <<include>>
Decision .> Audit : <<include>>
Review .> Outcome : <<include>>

note bottom of Review
The request belongs to an active Member. Staff or Manager reviews the request by hand.
Each Accepted, Rejected or Clarification Required decision requires a written explanation.
No AI result, automatic acceptance or automatic rejection is used.
end note
@enduml

